title: "Agentic Software Development — Enterprise Architecture with AI Agents"
subtitle: "Von kontrollierten Einzel-Runs zur parallelen Agentic Software Factory. Praxisbeispiele mit Java, Spring Boot und Domain-Driven Design"
version: "2.6"
date-released: "2026-08-08"
